WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
We didn't lead the way

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,600
Didn't say a word

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,320
They found it themselves

4
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:09,160
It seems they didn't bring people here on their own initiative.

5
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:20,030
There are no abnormalities in other areas

6
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:22,020
Only the pigeon that was humidified

7
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,340
Coming from the southeast direction

8
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:27,840
Estimated based on round trip time and flight speed

9
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,620
About seven kilometers away

10
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:32,010
The most suitable position within this range

11
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:33,250
It's Hotel Olligar

12
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:36,780
It's not there. You calculated it wrong.
